      at ['{d:.3g} отсчётов']
  [v02_double_slit] slit {j:d} is dark (it passes {r:.1e} of the other's): there is nothing to interfere with, |γ₁₂| = |G₁₂|/√(G₁₁G₂₂) is the indeterminate form 0/0
      -> щель {j:d} тёмная (пропускает {r:.1e} от другой): интерферировать не с чем, |γ₁₂| = |G₁₂|/√(G₁₁G₂₂) — неопределённость 0/0
      at ['{j:d} тёмная']
  [v02_double_slit] the particles are shifted on their way to the screen by up to ±{shift} with a screen of ±{half}: the expected pattern needs a grid of {n:.3g} points (~{gb:.3g} GB; the world's limit is {lim:g} GB)
